OL,3,GNEWSATrucks queuing at London Gateway
OL,4,Acontainer port
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong queues have built up around the
OL,7,FLondon Gateway container port in Essex.
OL,9,FA worker at the neighbouring logistics
OL,10,Fpark, who did not want to be named,
OL,11,Fsaid he believed the port's computer
OL,12,Fsystems had gone down at about 03:00
OL,13,FBST.
OL,15,FOn social media, HGV drivers reported
OL,16,Fbeing stuck in queues approaching the
OL,17,Fport, which is in Corringham, since
OL,18,F04:00 BST. Some stated they were three
OL,19,Fmiles away.
OL,21,FLondon Gateway has been contacted for
OL,22,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
